  "merger_description": "Ctrl Bidco Pty Ltd (**ctrl:cyber**) proposes to acquire 100% of the issued shares in Razilio Pty Ltd, trading as Razilio (**Razilio**), from Horatio Investments Pty Ltd as trustee for Horatio Investment Holdings (the **Acquisition**).\n\nctrl:cyber is an Australian-based provider of end-to-end cybersecurity, privacy and AI-governance services, servicing clients across Australia. Its brands include \u2018ctrl:cyber\u2019 (its core brand) and \u2018elevenM\u2019 (a business that provides privacy, cybersecurity, artificial intelligence and data governance solutions).\n\nRazilio is an Australian-based boutique cybersecurity and cyber resilience consulting business, servicing clients predominantly in New South Wales, Victoria and Queensland. Its brands include \u2018Razilio\u2019 (its core brand) and \u2018Meerkat\u2019 (a continuous exposure/attack-surface monitoring product).\n\nBoth ctrl:cyber and Razilio provide cybersecurity governance, risk and compliance advisory, cyber incident response planning and support, cyber threat detection and defence posture monitoring, and cyber awareness and training.",
